# The example is a React Native template with a screen of ours in it. Marked as vendored so the
# repository's language breakdown describes the SDK rather than the template's Gradle and Objective-C
# scaffolding, and kept out of `git archive` so a source tarball of this repository stays the docs it
# claims to be.
example/** linguist-vendored
example/** export-ignore

# Generated by Xcode and not worth a diff.
*.pbxproj -diff linguist-generated
